  "system": {
    "identifier": "shadowjack_ghostrunner",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"4330\" data-end=\"4357\">🏃 SHADOWJACK SUBCLASS</h2><h2 data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4374\">GHOSTRUNNER</h2><p data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4413\"><em data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4413\">“I was never where you think I was.”</em></p><h3 data-start=\"4415\" data-end=\"4435\">Subclass Fantasy</h3><p data-start=\"4436\" data-end=\"4489\">Ghostrunners specialize in <strong data-start=\"4463\" data-end=\"4488\">escape under pressure</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"4491\" data-end=\"4597\">Where other Shadowjacks infiltrate carefully, Ghostrunners infiltrate fast — and survive the consequences.</p><p data-start=\"4599\" data-end=\"4644\">They turn <strong data-start=\"4609\" data-end=\"4627\">pursuit itself</strong> into a resource.</p><p>Ghostrunners are:</p><ul data-start=\"6651\" data-end=\"6719\"><li data-start=\"6651\" data-end=\"6667\"><p data-start=\"6653\" data-end=\"6667\">Escape artists</p></li><li data-start=\"6668\" data-end=\"6686\"><p data-start=\"6670\" data-end=\"6686\">Pursuit breakers</p></li><li data-start=\"6687\" data-end=\"6719\"><p data-start=\"6689\" data-end=\"6719\">The reason ambushes fail twice</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6721\" data-end=\"6784\">They are not subtle forever.<br data-start=\"6749\" data-end=\"6752\" />They are gone before it matters.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
